Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:02.48,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, Maja!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢赫瓦林斯卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:07.26,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Magnificence in Wuhan,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N武汉的精彩一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:10.22,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she topples her fellow Pole, former world number one,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她击败同为波兰人的前世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:13.90,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for her first career top-10 win.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N收获生涯首场对前{\fs78}10{\fs68}球员的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.85,0:00:22.19,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}熟悉的两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:24.70,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}这次只能有一个往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:27.49,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}17{\fs68}日晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:29.79,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}武汉{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛女单半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.79,0:00:31.85,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}曾经的青少年双打搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:33.96,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}赫瓦林斯卡与斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:36.45,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}迎来巡回赛首次交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.65,0:00:40.68,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}首盘 月亮姐先以{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:42.89,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克没有让她把优势拉开
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.89,0:00:44.22,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}马上反击
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:45.38,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}比分很接近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:48.26,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}两个人都在争取把节奏拿回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:02.88,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 斯瓦泰克又拿到破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:04.90,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}两个人从底线反复拉锯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:07.02,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}谁都不肯先让出这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.73,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}这一次 她要把压力推到老搭档身上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.95,0:01:36.21,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}15{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.21,0:01:39.02,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克拿到两个连续盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.02,0:01:42.16,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}距离收下首盘 她只差一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.76,0:01:52.62,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, so, I’m going to send you a little bit,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那我也回敬你一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.62,0:01:54.10,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and give you some of your own medicine.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以其人之道还治其人之身
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:54.94,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How about that?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:56.27,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}第二个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:01:58.83,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}月亮姐从底线把球分向两侧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.83,0:02:01.14,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克横向跑动回击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:02.84,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}落点一次次被拉开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.84,0:02:06.23,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}月亮姐还在寻找向场内跟进的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:53.82,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja Chwalinska does it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:55.66,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Perhaps the unthinkable for some,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N或许有人觉得不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:58.18,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but not for her, not for her camp.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但她和她的团队并不这样想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:02.44,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Chwalinska hands Iga Swiatek her first dropped set in Wuhan{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她让斯瓦泰克在本届武汉首次丢盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:06.38,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and has the upper hand in semifinal number two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在第{\fs78}2{\fs68}场半决赛中占得先机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:09.49,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}现行{\fs78}10{\fs68}站{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.49,0:03:12.60,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克只差武汉的决赛经历
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:15.12,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}这一次 她没能跨过去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:18.74,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}比赛中 她因腿部不适接受医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:21.42,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}第二盘 月亮姐以{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}开局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.42,0:03:22.94,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}连着赢了{\fs78}6{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:24.74,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克追回一局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.74,0:03:26.94,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}却没能挽回走势
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:31.14,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 斯瓦泰克又面对破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:32.75,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她从底线打进场内
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:34.04,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}月亮姐左右移动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:36.62,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}把打向两侧的球连续救回
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:38.11,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克的进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.16,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}还要再多打一拍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:48.84,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}To lead 5-1 in the second set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N争取在第{\fs78}2{\fs68}盘以{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:03:59.66,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Now she’s unrelenting.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她仍然毫不松劲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:01.84,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She knows she’s oh so close.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她知道胜利已经近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:04.54,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja Chwalinska. Match point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡来到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:09.54,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, Maja!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢赫瓦林斯卡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.34,0:04:14.32,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Magnificence in Wuhan,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N武汉的精彩一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:17.28,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she topples her fellow Pole, former world number one,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她击败同为波兰人的前世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:20.96,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for her first career top-10 win.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N收获生涯首场对前{\fs78}10{\fs68}球员的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:30.26,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, genuine affection for each other,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N彼此之间有着真挚情谊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:33.52,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and you can see the affinity they have.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你能看出她们有多亲近
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:36.26,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}As undoubtedly Iga says, “Good luck tomorrow,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N想必伊加在说祝你明天好运
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:38.44,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as you vie for your first career title{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你将为生涯首冠而战
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:41.08,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and do so at a WTA 1000 event.”{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而且是在{\fs78}WTA1000{\fs68}赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:43.82,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克{\fs78}37{\fs68}个制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:46.32,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}也有{\fs78}33{\fs68}次非受迫失误
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:48.08,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}月亮姐{\fs78}19{\fs68}个制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:49.94,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}次非受迫失误
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:51.91,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}最后{\fs78}11{\fs68}局赢下{\fs78}10{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:55.05,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}她把首个{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛决赛握在了手里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:57.56,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}网前的拥抱之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:05:00.02,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}月亮姐要去迎接卡尔塔尔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:02.07,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克的武汉决赛梦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:03.70,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}今天没能完成
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:06.27,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}愿她尽快恢复 明天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.27,0:05:09.91,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}月亮姐能把这次突破 写成冠军吗？
